    {
      "block_id": "BL-6137-4.2.07-11",
      "block_type": "plain_explanation",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "The final coordinate answer should therefore include latitude, longitude, suitable precision and directions in the requested format. Check that the point lies within the labelled bounds and that south/east trends are read correctly. These checks connect numerical work with actual location rather than treating DMS as a list of digits disconnected from the map.",
