    {
      "block_id": "BL-6137-4.2.07-16",
      "block_type": "worked_application",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "Precision should match the resource. If marginal ticks show whole minutes and the point can be estimated halfway, thirty seconds can be a reasonable stated interpolation. If the image is too coarse or the position uncertain, extra digits do not add accuracy. A result with the correct hemisphere and justified precision is more useful than a long unsupported decimal.",
      "claim_ids": [
        "CL-6137-4.2.07-1",
        "CL-6137-4.2.07-2",
        "CL-6137-4.2.07-01-1",
