    {
      "block_id": "BL-6137-4.2.07-17",
      "block_type": "plain_explanation",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "Finally, check coordinate order against the requested format. Latitude-first is used here, while some software interfaces store longitude before latitude. Swapping the order can locate a completely different point without changing any digits. Name the quantities or use their suffixes so the result remains unambiguous when transferred from a map to a table or another tool.",
